            "body": "Hello, shouldn't we try to focus on 'underlying needs' to design the API, instead of focusing what we usually do and unifying it 🤔\n\nAFAIK What a filesystem slug really is for is to have persistent storage to store arbitrary data per file-'identity' (usually its file path).",
